<title>USA: Fortress buys assets of Brookstone Homes.</title>
<headline>Fortress buys assets of Brookstone Homes.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fortress Group Inc on Monday said that it bought the house-building assets of Brookstone Homes Inc of Janesville, Wisconsin.</p>
<p>The terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>During the last 12 months, Brookstone Homes generated more than $17 million in revenues. The company built houses that ranged in price from $95,000 to $150,000.</p>
<p>The Fortress Group builds single- and multi-family residences in a variety of market segments.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
